# What the server build does not read.
#
# `programs/` is over a gigabyte of SBF build output, and `frontend/` changes far
# more often than the server does — excluding it means a frontend commit leaves
# the build context byte-identical and the cached image is reused whole.
#
# `fixtures/` stays: engine/src/lib.rs embeds fixtures/program-id.txt at compile
# time. `docs/examples/` is embedded only by tests, which `cargo build` does not
# compile, so it is excluded.

.git
.github
target/
node_modules/
dist/
artifacts/
data/
programs/
frontend/
docs/
examples/
scripts/
test-ledger/
*.md
.env
.env.*
report.json
.DS_Store
